# Kaito, Bane of Nightmares: "During your turn, as long as Kaito has one or more loyalty counters on him, he's a 3/4
# Ninja creature". Artificial Evolution changes his text, Ninja to Elf (CR 612.1), so on his controller's turn he is a
# 3/4 Elf creature, not a Ninja (CR 612), and on the opponent's turn he is a planeswalker again.

